 de Jerusalem en la daŭro de via tuta vivo.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Kaj vi vidos la infanojn de viaj infanoj.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Paco al Izrael!","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/epo_bfb/PSA/128.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/epo_bfb/PSA/129.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/epo_bfb/PSA/127.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":6}